{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10217","headline":"送从弟永任饶州录事参军 · 李嘉佑","name":"送从弟永任饶州录事参军","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一官万里向千溪，水宿山行鱼浦西。\n日晚长烟高岸近，天寒积雪远峰低。\n芦花渚里鸿相呌，苦竹丛边猨暗啼。\n闻道慈亲倚门待，到时兰叶正萋萋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李嘉佑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10217.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10217","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}